{"id":"loglevel-test-stoppedwithin","parent":"flaky-tests","ord":"a7","title":"logLevel.test.ts still uses the kill-then-stoppedWithin shape #364 fixed in lock.test.ts","todo":true,"created":"2026-08-24T09:18:58-04:00","custom":{"from":"#364's opencode reviewer (comment 5391184904, NIT 4): logLevel.test.ts:35,53 attach close after kill — on a busy box burns a full timeout per call; on an early-dead child fails 'expected false to be true' despite the child having stopped","shape":"same fix as #364's (ride the spawn-time exited() listener, hang throws); not yet observed failing — filed pre-emptively on the reviewer's analysis. Morning triage"}}
